<title>USA: Allied Capital Commercial Corp Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital Commercial Corp Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					     3 mos. ended  3 mos. ended</p>
<p>						     3/31/97	3/31/96</p>
<p>Operating Information</p>
<p> Total investment income			11,987	 10,093</p>
<p> Net margin on investments		     8,624	  7,796</p>
<p>Income before gains and minority</p>
<p>  interests					  6,591	  5,722</p>
<p> Net realized gains				  351	  1,808</p>
<p> Net income					  6,636	  6,855</p>
