<p>						     3/31/96     12/31/96</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported capital gain income of $351,000 or $0.02 per share for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes capital gain income of $1.8 million or $0.13 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
